OL,3,GNEWSAFamily prepare to eat 52-year-old 
OL,4,AChristmas pudding                      
OL,6,FTina Dutson, her granddaughter, said:  
OL,7,F"I think it probably will be all right.
OL,8,FThey will keep, I don't know how long, 
OL,9,For whether 50 years is going to be a   
OL,10,Fbit much."                             
